- Track `frame: usize` (0..10), `rolls_in_frame: usize`, `pins_left: u16`.

- On `roll(pins)`:

  - if game complete -> `GameComplete`.

  - if pins > pins_left -> `NotEnoughPinsLeft` (since cannot knock more than standing).

