reused and the old name was removed from `_used_names`. The requirement is that every existing robot has a 
unique name, but the test expects a reset robot to get a *different* name from its previous one even when the 
RNG is reseeded to the same sequence. To fix this, we must ensure that once a name has been used (even if the 
robot is reset), it is never reused by any robot (including the same robot after reset). So we should not 
discard the name from `_used_names` on reset; instead we keep it reserved forever.



