- The game starts with 9 remaining guesses and status `STATUS_ONGOING`.
- `guess(char)` should record correct/incorrect guesses, update remaining guesses, and update status. If the game has ended, it must raise `ValueError("The game has already ended.")`.
- `get_masked_word()` should return the word with unguessed letters masked as underscores (or similar). It needs the original word and the set of guessed characters.
