If `defs.go` already defines `Dir`, `Rect`, `Xy`, etc., there may be duplicate declarations; however, you only supplied `robot_simulator.go` and said to modify it, so I included the necessary types locally. If `defs.go` is present in the actual code base, you may need to remove the duplicate type definitions (like `Dir`, `Rect`, `Xy`) from this file to avoid compilation errors. But per instructions, I only edited the given file.

