Currently, `New` skips empty lines (`if line == "" { continue }`). To fix this, we must treat any empty line as invalid and return an error instead of ignoring it. Also, we should not skip empty lines; if a line is empty after trimming, that's an error. Additionally, we should still check for rectangular shape and parse errors.

