The typical algorithm for "two bucket" puzzle (with the extra forbidden rule) is:



- Fill start bucket (move 1)

- Loop:

  - If the other bucket is full, empty it (move++).

  - Else, pour from start bucket to other bucket (move++). (This automatically stops when start is empty or 
other is full.)

  - After pour, if start bucket is empty, fill it (move++).

