I will refactor `tree_building.py` to:
1. Improve performance by avoiding nested loops and redundant searches.
2. Use clear, meaningful `ValueError` messages as required.
3. Keep the same class and function names.

Changes needed:
- Replace the O(n²) nested loops with O(n) dictionary-based lookups.
- Validate records properly: IDs must be contiguous from 0, root must have parent == id == 0, and child id must be greater than parent id.
