Below is a refactored version of `ledger.go`. I kept the public API (`Entry`, `FormatLedger`) unchanged and made the code more readable, removed concurrency (which was unsafe and unnecessary), simplified sorting, and extracted helper functions. A change log is included as a comment at the top of the file per the instructions.

