Also, to avoid ESM/CJS issues, we can keep `export class` (since the test environment likely uses ESM). But if tests use `require`, we might need `module.exports`. However the instruction says "Only use standard libraries, don't suggest installing any packages." and "don't change names". We'll keep `export` as given.

